<title>NORWAY: Record traffic at Norway's Mongstad in August.</title>
<headline>Record traffic at Norway's Mongstad in August.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Den norske stats oljeselskap AS (Statoil) said on Thursday 4.4 million tonnes of crude oil were loaded or discharged in August at the Mongstad terminal on the west coast of Norway.</p>
<p>Exports of refined oil products at the port totalled 740,000 tonnes in August, according to the company's Status Weekly newsletter.</p>
<p>Vessel traffic to and from Mongstad set a record in August at 174 calls, including 34 by crude carriers, Statoil said.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
